This directory contains a modified version of OpenEvolve by codelion and
contributors, https://github.com/codelion/openevolve, under Apache License 2.0.

The EvoDiverse authors added temperature-dependent population selection,
parallel-tempering swaps, adaptive swap scaling, and a circle-packing experiment
with a Python runner that supports environment-based API configuration.

The original Apache License 2.0 text is preserved.
